gon/361/Realmslore:_Ironfang_Keep\n  5.05%    6.978      1 Template:Cite_dragon\n  4.11%    5.676      1 Template:Cite_book/The_Grand_History_of_the_Realms\n  3.11%    4.297      1 Template:Cite_book/Forgotten_Realms_Campaign_Setting_3rd_edition\n-->\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.8_prod_forgottenrealms:pcache:idhash:19351-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260516013840 and revision id 974212. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","error":null,"source":{"wiki":"forgottenrealms.fandom.com","url":"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/api.php?action=parse&format=json&prop=text&page=Ironfang%20Keep","fetchedAt":"2026-05-17T07:01:47Z"}}